package: @astryxdesign/cli

## 为应用添加主题

安装主题包，用 `<Theme>`（`import {Theme} from '@astryxdesign/core/theme'`）包裹应用，选择浅色或深色模式。完整指南——可用主题、集成主题、深色模式、嵌套主题和生产构建——请参阅 `npx @astryxdesign/cli@0.7.12 docs use-a-theme`。

Wire the generated module once:
```tsx
import {Theme} from '@astryxdesign/core/theme';
import {themes, defaultThemeSlug} from './astryx-themes';

function App() {
  return (
    <Theme theme={themes[defaultThemeSlug]}>
      <YourApp />
    </Theme>
  );
}
```

